Visualization — inline SVG, server-rendered, zero client JavaScript, one
palette validated for colour-vision deficiency and contrast in light AND dark
(dataviz validator: Operations #178A62 · Energy #2a78d6 · Physical AI #c2571f;
dark steps #2AA078 · #4489e2 · #d96a33). Text always wears text tokens.
- components/viz/ClusterMap        three clusters + contract arrows, labels hand-anchored
- components/viz/ContractSequence  event → work order → result, human-approval gate from schema
- components/viz/MaturityLadder    every registry entry on the maturity axis, tier by shape
- components/viz/StatusBars        registry by constitutional status
- components/viz/Funnel            50/10/3/1 against targets, counted from evidence
- components/viz/ObjectiveRing     radial meter per objective; 0 draws no arc
- components/viz/PeriodTimeline    13 week slots, today marker, filed/missing reports
- components/viz/ScoreHeatmap      15 workflows × 6 dimensions, hatched = unscored
- components/viz/Sparkline         52-week commit pulse, 2px line, 10% wash, ringed end dot
- components/viz/PulseBoard        small multiples on a shared scale, live from GitHub
- lib/github.ts                    commitActivity()/registryActivity() — 202/unreachable → null
- new /cluster/map/                every picture on one page
- home, architecture, registry (+detail), roadmap, workflows, contracts gain visuals
- dark theme via prefers-color-scheme; wide diagrams scroll inside their figure on phones
- header/footer widened to the control-room measure

Agentic discoverability — an agent landing anywhere on the host finds everything:
- /llms.txt, /llms-full.txt, /ai.txt  generated from content (lib/llms.ts); static public/llms.txt removed
- /openapi.json                       OpenAPI 3.1 for every read-only endpoint
- /api/cluster/schema/                JSON Schema 2020-12; enums held to types.ts by tsc exhaustiveness checks
- /.well-known/api-catalog            RFC 9727 linkset; advertised via Link: rel="api-catalog" on every response
- /api/cluster/{resource}/            mandate, constitution, clusters, decisions, kill-list, roadmap,
                                      evidence, workflows, reports, agents, contracts, watchlist
- /api/cluster/registry/{slug}/       one entry + live GitHub meta + commit activity
- /api/cluster/feed.xml               Atom feed of decisions, kill list, weekly reports
- /manifest.webmanifest, robots.txt naming and allowing every documented AI crawler,
  <link rel="alternate"> for JSON/OpenAPI/linkset/llms/feeds, CORS GET on the API
- lib/cluster-api.ts: one endpoint table drives routes, OpenAPI, catalog and llms.txt

Verified: tsc clean, verify-cluster OK, next build green (83 routes), heading
order valid on every new page, screenshots reviewed in light, dark and mobile.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
